hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1841","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Abi Habab Saeed se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo paak kamai se sadqa kare, aur Allah paak ke siwa qubool nahi karta, to goya wo use Rahman ki hatheli mein rakhta hai jo use paalta hai jaisa tum mein se aik apne bache ya oont ke bache ko paalta hai yahan tak ke pahad jaisa ho jae."
"1842","Mujhe Malik ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Malik ke bete Anas ko kehte suna ke Talha ke bete Abu Talha Madina mein khajoor se maal mein Ansar mein sab se zyada they aur un ke maal mein se unhein Bairuha sab se pasand tha jabke wo masjid ke samne thi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is mein dakhil hote aur is mein jo umda pani tha pite. Anas ne kaha ke phir jab ye aayat nazil hui ke tum neki ko na paoge yahan tak ke jo pasand karte ho kharch karo, to Talha ke bete Abu Talha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khade hue aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah Allah Tabarak wa Taala kehte hain ke tum neki ko na paoge yahan tak ke jo pasand karte ho kharch karo, aur mere maal mein se mujhe Bairuha sab se pasand hai aur ye Allah ke liye sadqa hai, main us ki neki aur us ke zakhira ki Allah ke paas umeed rakhta hun, to use ya Rasulullah jahan chahein rakhein. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wah ye nafa wala maal hai, ye nafa wala maal hai, aur maine sun liya hai jo tum ne is mein kaha aur meri rai hai ke use qareeb walon mein rakho. To Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne kaha ke karunga ya Rasulullah, to Talha ke bete Abu Talha ne use apne rishtedaron aur chacha zadon mein taqseem kya."
"1843","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mangne wale ko do agarche wo ghode par aae."
"1844","Mujhe Malik ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ashhali Ansari Muaz ke bete Amr se, unhon ne apni dadi se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aye momin auraton tum mein se koi apni padosan ko tohfa dene ko haqeer na samjhe agarche bakri ka jala hua khur ho."
"1845","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se khabar pahunchi ke miskeen ne un se manga jabke wo rozedar thin aur un ke ghar mein roti ke siwa kuchh na tha, to unhon ne apni azad karda se kaha ke use use do. To us ne kaha ke tumhare paas wo nahi jis se iftar karo. To unhon ne kaha ke use use do. Unhon ne kaha ke us ne aisa kya. Unhon ne kaha ke phir jab hum ne shaam ki to hum par ghar walon ne ya insan ne tohfa bheja jo hum par tohfa bhejte they, bakri aur us ka kafan, to Momineen ki maan Aaisha ne mujhe bulaya aur kaha ke is mein se khao, ye tumhari tikiya se behtar hai."
"1846","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke miskeen ne Momineen ki maan Aaisha se khana manga jabke un ke samne angoor they, to unhon ne insan se kaha ke dana lo aur use use do, to wo us ki taraf dekhne laga aur taajjub karne laga, to Aaisha ne kaha ke kya tum taajjub karte ho, tum is dane mein zarra barabar mein se kitne dekhte ho."
"1847","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Laithi Yazeed ke bete Ata se, unhon ne Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se riwayat kya ke Ansar mein se logon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se manga to Aap ne inhein diya phir unhon ne Aap se manga to Aap ne inhein diya yahan tak ke jo Aap ke paas tha khatm ho gaya, phir farmaya ke jo bhalai mere paas hogi use tum se na rokunga, aur jo pakdamani chahen Allah use pakdaman karega, aur jo beniyaz ho Allah use ghani karega, aur jo sabr kare Allah use sabr dega, aur kisi ko koi atiya na diya gaya jo sabr se behtar aur wasee ho."
"1848","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jabke Aap mimbar par they aur sadqe aur mangne se pakdamani ka zikr kar rahe they, ke upar wala haath neeche wale haath se behtar hai, aur upar wala haath kharch karne wala hai aur neeche wala mangne wala hai."
"1849","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umar bin Khattab ki taraf atiya bheja to Umar ne use lautaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke tum ne use kyun lautaya. To us ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah kya aap ne hamein khabar na di ke hum mein se aik ke liye behtar hai ke kisi se koi cheez na le. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to mangne se hai, aur jo baghair mange ho wo rizq hai jo Allah tumhein deta hai. To Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke raha main, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai main kisi se koi cheez na mangunga aur na mere paas baghair mange koi cheez aaegi magar use lunga."
"1850","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai ke tum mein se aik apni rassi le aur apni peeth par lakdiyan laade ye us ke liye behtar hai ke wo mard ke paas aae jise Allah ne apne fazl se diya ho aur is se mange, use de ya mana kare."
"1851","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se, unhon ne Asad ke Banu mein se mard se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main aur mere ghar wale Baqi-ul-Gharqad mein utre to mere ghar walon ne mujh se kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao aur humare liye Aap se koi cheez mango jo hum khaein. Aur wo apni haajat zikr karne lage. To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas gaya aur Aap ke paas mard ko paya jo Aap se mang raha tha jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke main wo nahi pata jo tumhein dun. To wo mard Aap se munsarif hua jabke wo gusse mein tha aur kehta tha ke meri umr ki qasam tum to use dete ho jo chaho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo mujh par gussa karta hai ke main wo nahi pata jo use dun, tum mein se jo mange jabke us ke paas ooqiya ya us ke barabar ho to us ne chipat kar manga. Asadi ne kaha ke maine kaha ke hamari doodh wali oontni ooqiya se behtar hai. Malik ne kaha ke ooqiya chalis dirham hai. Unhon ne kaha ke main lauta aur Aap se na manga, phir Aap ke paas is ke baad jau aur kishmish aayi aur humare liye is mein se taqseem kya yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jal ne hamein ghani kar diya."
"1852","Aur Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Ala se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke sadqe ne maal mein kami na ki aur Allah ne bande ko muafi se izzat ke siwa zyada na kya aur banda tawazo na karega magar Allah use buland karega. Malik ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke ye hadis Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uthate hain ya nahi."
"1853","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Aal Muhammad ke liye sadqa halal nahi, ye to logon ka mail hai."
"1854","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ashhal ke Banu mein se mard ko sadqe par aamil banaya, phir jab wo aaya to Aap se sadqe mein se oont manga to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gusse hue yahan tak ke gussa Aap ke chehre mein pehchana gaya, aur is mein se tha jis se gussa Aap ke chehre mein pehchana jata tha ke Aap ki dono aankhein surkh hotin, phir farmaya ke mard mujh se mangta hai jo mere liye aur na us ke liye durust nahi, phir agar use mana karun to mana karna napasand karta hun aur agar use dun to use dunga jo mere liye aur na us ke liye durust nahi. To mard ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah main is mein se koi cheez kabhi na mangunga."
"1855","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Arqam ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke mujhe sawariyon mein se oont par dalalat karo jis par Ameerul Momineen sawari karein, to maine kaha ke haan sadqe ka oont. To Arqam ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke kya tum pasand karte ho ke mota mard garmi ke din mein tumhare tehband ke neeche aur janghon ko dhoye phir tumhein de aur tum use piyo. Unhon ne kaha ke main gusse hua aur kaha ke Allah tumhein bakhshe, tum mujh se aisa kehte ho. To Arqam ke bete Abdullah ne kaha ke sadqa to logon ka mail hai jo wo apne upar se dho kar utarte hain."
